<section class="container page-intro about-hero"><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">About GoldfishStudio</p><h1 class="heading">The person<br/> <em>behind the camera.</em></h1><p>I’m J. Murray, the videographer and photographer behind GoldfishStudio. Based in the Netherlands, I work with brands, organisations and people who have a story to share.</p><p>An event, an interview, a podcast or a commercial: each project needs a different approach. I look at what you want to share, who it is for and which images fit.</p><p>From the first conversation to filming, editing, colour and sound. You discuss your project directly with the person creating the images.</p><a class="underlink" href="/en/work">View the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="about-image"><img src="https://image.mux.com/JA7D3foAf02DySqLel39EZCXM9Jq00KhsRU8lHWPZ5x6U/thumbnail.jpg?width=1100" alt="Still from the Pathfinder Day event production"/></div></section>
